WEBVTT

00:05.640 --> 00:08.810
Ah... I wanna see Cecilia...

00:08.810 --> 00:12.830
Captain! Let's get going 
to Celia's mansion!

00:12.830 --> 00:14.700
Cecilia's not there. I'll pass.

00:14.700 --> 00:15.850
What?!

00:15.850 --> 00:18.660
I haven't seen her in a whole week now.

00:18.660 --> 00:23.710
From what she said, everyone in 
the hero's party is pretty busy.

00:24.820 --> 00:29.710
Cecilia goes to different towns and 
villages to heal their wounded...

00:30.460 --> 00:32.720
Raven is the captain of the knights...

00:33.190 --> 00:35.640
Mikana is a palace mage...

00:36.790 --> 00:41.300
and Yuga does diplomatic work as well 
as dealing with high-rank monsters.

00:42.330 --> 00:44.270
They're all scattered all the time.

00:44.270 --> 00:46.730
I bet they don't get many chances to talk.

00:47.620 --> 00:49.010
And this is all because of me.

00:49.010 --> 00:51.230
I wish I could do something for them.

00:51.230 --> 00:53.740
This is boring! I'm bored!

00:56.140 --> 00:59.380
Man, if only Duke was here...

00:59.380 --> 01:00.870
Look, you...

01:00.870 --> 01:05.210
I can't believe he joined the knights 
after their captain scouted him.

01:06.690 --> 01:07.590
Come in.

01:09.150 --> 01:10.210
Hi.

01:10.210 --> 01:11.980
Hey, Happy!

01:11.980 --> 01:13.950
Oh, hey. What's up?

01:14.260 --> 01:16.280
Message from milady.

01:16.900 --> 01:19.300
"I'll be at home this afternoon,"

01:19.300 --> 01:20.220
she says.

01:20.660 --> 01:22.150
Really?!

01:22.150 --> 01:26.790
I'll finally get my chance 
to give her the necklace!

03:01.770 --> 03:04.200
What should I do until the afternoon?

03:04.600 --> 03:07.950
Shiek went ahead to the 
mansion with Happiness, so...

03:08.630 --> 03:10.010
You there.

03:12.380 --> 03:16.150
You are doomed to have 
terrible luck today.

03:16.150 --> 03:18.420
I'm not falling for that nonsense.

03:19.320 --> 03:21.250
I get to see the girl I love.

03:21.630 --> 03:24.220
It's obviously gonna be an awesome day!

03:26.260 --> 03:28.140
Welcome!

03:36.570 --> 03:38.130
Where's the lady who's usually here?

03:38.130 --> 03:39.990
My sister had other stuff to do,

03:40.340 --> 03:42.140
so I'm looking after the store today!

03:42.590 --> 03:44.160
R-Really?

03:44.590 --> 03:47.910
Then... I'll take these. They're a gift.

03:48.380 --> 03:50.370
Thank you very much!

03:51.390 --> 03:53.170
Come again!

03:53.420 --> 03:56.700
Please hurry back, little sister.

03:58.510 --> 04:00.130
Hey, they're all crushed!

04:00.550 --> 04:03.290
Don't put so much muscle 
into packing cakes.

04:04.730 --> 04:06.760
They still taste good, though.

04:11.420 --> 04:12.700
I'm sorry.

04:16.900 --> 04:20.190
Whoa, close call!

04:21.130 --> 04:24.330
Maybe today really is my unlucky day...

04:28.030 --> 04:28.990
Whoa!

04:33.230 --> 04:35.400
My skewer!

04:35.400 --> 04:38.040
Hey, c'mon, don't cry.

04:38.290 --> 04:39.550
Thank you.

04:41.090 --> 04:44.010
Here. I even got you an extra.

04:44.520 --> 04:46.540
Watch where you walk from now on, okay?

04:46.980 --> 04:47.780
Okay!

04:48.370 --> 04:51.010
Thank you, mister!

04:54.660 --> 04:55.900
Sheesh.

04:57.400 --> 04:58.510
Oops!

05:01.140 --> 05:03.280
Now I get pickpocketed?!

05:03.500 --> 05:05.240
He won't get away!

05:19.330 --> 05:22.400
Man, I can't believe I got pickpocketed.

05:22.400 --> 05:24.340
A robbery in broad daylight?

05:25.340 --> 05:28.270
Return the wallet you stole from him!

05:28.590 --> 05:29.940
Yuga!

05:31.320 --> 05:33.340
Actually, this is my wallet...

05:33.340 --> 05:34.770
Liar!

05:40.440 --> 05:42.150
My money!

05:42.150 --> 05:43.240
Halt!

05:43.240 --> 05:43.810
Hang on!

05:43.810 --> 05:45.740
Just listen to me!

05:50.980 --> 05:53.580
Give up and confess your crime already.

05:54.270 --> 05:57.580
My luck really is awful today...

06:05.880 --> 06:07.540
This sucks.

06:08.730 --> 06:12.280
Were you starting to miss 
your shut-in lifestyle?

06:13.910 --> 06:14.980
Duke!

06:16.300 --> 06:19.020
Captain, what did you do?

06:19.480 --> 06:22.600
Did you turn delinquent because Cecilia 
wouldn't give you the time of day?

06:22.600 --> 06:23.870
No, I did not!

06:24.190 --> 06:25.860
Relax. I know.

06:26.220 --> 06:29.910
Raven's verifying the facts right 
now. Just hang in there a bit longer.

06:30.140 --> 06:31.690
What a relief.

06:31.690 --> 06:35.170
Hey, you should be 
calling Raven "Captain."

06:35.170 --> 06:36.910
You're a knight now.

06:36.910 --> 06:40.790
You're my only captain, Captain.

06:40.790 --> 06:42.070
Oh, come on...

06:42.410 --> 06:46.490
I call him "Captain" in public, 
so it's not a problem.

06:46.490 --> 06:47.740
Pardon me.

06:48.670 --> 06:50.250
Irene.

06:50.250 --> 06:53.300
Duke, you need to return to your training.

06:53.300 --> 06:56.680
The vice captain is angry with 
you for leaving on your own.

06:56.680 --> 06:59.020
Her ears... Is she an elf?

06:59.020 --> 07:01.440
Forget about that. Give me the key.

07:01.440 --> 07:03.940
The captain did his 
interrogation, didn't he?

07:04.770 --> 07:07.650
That should've cleared this guy's name.

07:08.620 --> 07:11.260
Yes, Yoki is innocent.

07:11.260 --> 07:12.320
Yes!

07:12.690 --> 07:16.860
And the hero says he'd 
like to apologize to you.

07:17.800 --> 07:18.490
Wha?

07:22.290 --> 07:25.790
I caused you all that trouble. 
Let me make it up to you!

07:28.630 --> 07:31.630
Go on! Eat all you like!

07:31.940 --> 07:33.830
Yow! You're blinding me!

07:36.140 --> 07:37.550
Thanks for treating.

07:37.550 --> 07:40.140
The food here is great, isn't it?

07:40.390 --> 07:43.560
So I hear you're friends with Raven?

07:43.560 --> 07:44.400
Huh?

07:44.670 --> 07:46.650
THINK ABOUT WHAT YOU DID!

07:46.650 --> 07:50.330
He's never scolded me this much before.

07:52.280 --> 07:54.500
I didn't notice before,

07:54.850 --> 07:58.470
but you're the guy who was with 
Cecilia the other day, right?

07:59.030 --> 07:59.910
Yeah.

07:59.910 --> 08:02.470
What's your relationship with her?

08:02.920 --> 08:06.140
Huh? We're just friends. Why?

08:06.140 --> 08:07.300
Oh...

08:07.860 --> 08:11.190
So you managed to become 
friends with Cecilia...

08:14.140 --> 08:17.930
Please! Could you give me some advice?

08:21.910 --> 08:26.180
I just want to know how I can 
get on better terms with her.

08:30.430 --> 08:33.550
I'm your rival in love, you know!

08:35.340 --> 08:39.460
Sorry, but I only met Cecilia recently.

08:39.460 --> 08:42.500
Maybe you should ask someone 
who's known her longer?

08:42.220 --> 08:43.960
NOT ME.

08:44.310 --> 08:48.060
Raven, you don't need to 
worry about your voice.

08:49.250 --> 08:51.460
Discover some tact, hero!

08:51.460 --> 08:55.470
HOW ABOUT MIKANA?

08:53.820 --> 08:55.470
I can't ask Mikana.

08:55.800 --> 08:58.470
I think she hates Cecilia.

08:59.410 --> 09:01.550
Did Mikana say that herself?

09:03.940 --> 09:06.190
You might not believe this,

09:06.510 --> 09:11.480
but Mikana tried to leave Cecilia 
behind in a certain battle we fought.

09:15.300 --> 09:19.160
Thankfully, Cecilia was fine in the end,

09:19.160 --> 09:22.480
but it's too cruel. Even 
if she does hate her...

09:22.480 --> 09:23.250
Wait.

09:23.530 --> 09:24.540
Huh?

09:24.990 --> 09:27.370
Are you serious about that?

09:30.630 --> 09:33.130
It wasn't Mikana who abandoned Cecilia.

09:33.130 --> 09:35.270
What would you know?!

09:35.270 --> 09:37.050
You weren't even there!

09:38.350 --> 09:41.540
You're right. I heard 
the story from Mikana.

09:42.550 --> 09:45.750
She wasn't the one who said 
to leave Cecilia behind.

09:46.580 --> 09:50.560
It was a powerful demon you'd fought 
countless times, but you kept losing.

09:50.560 --> 09:54.520
Yes, but I tried to refuse,

09:54.520 --> 09:57.340
and Mikana said we should 
take him up on the deal!

09:57.340 --> 10:01.070
She couldn't have done that 
if she didn't hate Cecilia.

10:01.370 --> 10:03.080
She left her because she hated her?

10:03.720 --> 10:05.580
Mikana was crying when she said that!

10:06.390 --> 10:08.540
She felt that guilty about it!

10:09.970 --> 10:12.260
What? Mikana cried?

10:12.260 --> 10:14.750
But she's the one who told me to agree!

10:14.750 --> 10:16.720
It was all her fault!

10:16.720 --> 10:18.390
Get real!

10:18.390 --> 10:19.970
Remember what happened that day!

10:20.330 --> 10:22.380
When Cecilia told you to go ahead,

10:22.380 --> 10:24.770
it was you who made the final decision!

10:25.460 --> 10:28.090
Did Mikana tell you that, too?

10:29.260 --> 10:30.860
Why does that matter?

10:31.930 --> 10:34.260
Is what I just said wrong?

10:34.630 --> 10:38.990
It's true, but it's not what 
you think! Please understand!

10:38.990 --> 10:42.490
I wasn't the one who abandoned Cecilia!

10:42.490 --> 10:43.800
I couldn't!

10:44.370 --> 10:45.740
I could never...

10:53.250 --> 10:54.980
You're the hero, aren't you?

10:55.330 --> 10:57.760
Don't dump the blame on your allies.

10:59.260 --> 11:01.710
Face up to your own actions.

11:01.710 --> 11:03.230
If you can't do that...

11:04.670 --> 11:06.490
that's a really bad look for you.

11:17.910 --> 11:20.210
I-I'm sorry! I went too far!

11:20.210 --> 11:21.740
Just calm down, okay?

11:23.890 --> 11:25.990
I'm sorry I lost my composure.

11:26.380 --> 11:28.540
I've known Mikana since we were kids.

11:29.950 --> 11:31.710
She's a really hard worker.

11:32.850 --> 11:36.000
Whenever I screw up, she 
scolds me until I learn.

11:36.230 --> 11:39.290
She's always been with me, supporting me.

11:40.380 --> 11:43.720
Even after I was chosen as the 
hero, she never stopped.

11:44.760 --> 11:47.920
And yet the way I treated 
her was horrible.

11:47.920 --> 11:49.510
What can I do?

11:50.030 --> 11:53.580
Just let her scold you like always.

11:56.490 --> 11:58.290
People who scold you

11:58.970 --> 12:02.190
do it because they care about you.

12:02.190 --> 12:05.280
So let her scold you for this, too.

12:05.530 --> 12:10.310
If that doesn't work... well, you'll 
have to think of something else.

12:12.610 --> 12:15.130
Okay. I'll apologize to her.

12:15.610 --> 12:17.750
Thanks, Yoki!

12:18.220 --> 12:21.260
This guy's almost too honest.

12:21.260 --> 12:24.760
THIS IS JUST HOW HE IS.

12:21.940 --> 12:23.590
Or maybe he's just childish.

12:25.130 --> 12:27.510
Well, Yoki, Raven...

12:27.510 --> 12:30.150
I'm gonna go see Mikana!

12:30.770 --> 12:32.750
Good! Go get 'er!

12:34.770 --> 12:37.300
But I don't trust myself to go alone.

12:37.300 --> 12:38.270
Come with me!

12:38.270 --> 12:39.160
Huh?!

12:43.180 --> 12:45.070
This is Mikana's house.

12:46.200 --> 12:48.830
Damn it, don't drag me 
around against my will.

12:49.180 --> 12:53.620
But, I mean... I didn't have 
the courage to do it alone.

12:53.620 --> 12:56.780
You can just wait for me outside.

12:58.330 --> 13:00.360
Okay, fine.

13:00.110 --> 13:01.800
GET GOING.

13:02.070 --> 13:04.580
Thanks! I'm going now!

13:06.380 --> 13:09.590
I'll be keeping Cecilia waiting a bit,

13:10.420 --> 13:13.770
but if this will fix the rift 
in the hero's party, then...

13:14.300 --> 13:15.490
Mikana!

13:20.080 --> 13:26.700
NOTHING NEW HERE.

13:20.970 --> 13:26.700
I forgot about his Lucky Pervert power!

13:27.210 --> 13:30.840
Please don't say anything! 
Just hear me out!

13:30.840 --> 13:31.660
What?!

13:31.660 --> 13:36.670
I realized that I did 
something awful to you!

13:36.670 --> 13:39.670
You're doing something 
awful to me right now!

13:39.670 --> 13:40.570
I always...

13:40.570 --> 13:41.390
Listen to me!

13:41.390 --> 13:42.670
...cause trouble for you.

13:43.230 --> 13:46.830
I even blamed you for my 
decision to sacrifice Cecilia,

13:46.830 --> 13:48.450
and that hurt you.

13:50.590 --> 13:52.340
I'm so sorry!

13:53.690 --> 13:55.070
Yuga...

13:56.180 --> 13:58.690
I know apologizing won't fix it,

13:59.480 --> 14:02.370
but if you'll forgive me, then...

14:04.970 --> 14:08.200
I want you to continue 
scolding me like always!

14:18.390 --> 14:21.860
You barge in here and pin 
me down while I'm changing,

14:21.860 --> 14:24.920
and you tell me you want me to scold you?

14:25.570 --> 14:28.430
Have you developed masochist inclinations?

14:28.430 --> 14:30.910
Huh? It's not like that, Mikana!

14:30.910 --> 14:32.830
I just came to apologize for...

14:32.830 --> 14:35.350
I'll scold you whether 
you tell me to or not!

14:35.850 --> 14:39.600
Yuga, you stupid pervert!

14:42.570 --> 14:45.070
Raven, you can take it from here.

14:49.060 --> 14:51.490
I have to hurry to the mansion!

14:51.490 --> 14:53.230
Oh, it's you, young man.

14:53.230 --> 14:57.310
Oh, I don't believe in 
fortunes, so... bye!

14:59.270 --> 15:01.690
His fortune has changed.

15:01.690 --> 15:04.460
He must have done lots of good deeds.

15:04.460 --> 15:06.070
You there!

15:06.070 --> 15:08.970
You bought some cakes 
from us earlier, right?

15:09.370 --> 15:10.690
Yes, I did...

15:11.010 --> 15:16.350
I'm sorry. Were the cakes 
my brother sold you crushed?

15:16.350 --> 15:17.980
Oh, yeah...

15:17.980 --> 15:20.310
But they still tasted good, so it's fine.

15:20.580 --> 15:23.660
Please take these cakes as an apology.

15:23.660 --> 15:24.790
Are you sure?

15:30.580 --> 15:32.410
What now?

15:32.410 --> 15:34.280
It was you, was it not?

15:34.700 --> 15:39.290
I humbly apologize for the trouble 
our young master caused you.

15:39.290 --> 15:40.780
Young master?

15:40.780 --> 15:42.790
Oh, the kid with the skewer!

15:43.190 --> 15:47.580
He ran off to play the moment 
I took my eyes off him.

15:47.580 --> 15:49.930
Please accept this as an apology.

15:51.990 --> 15:54.260
Excuse me...

15:54.260 --> 15:55.450
You're late.

15:55.450 --> 15:58.370
I went through a lot today, okay?!

16:02.010 --> 16:04.980
Yoki, it's good to see you again.

16:05.210 --> 16:08.730
Yeah, it feels like it's been 
a month since I last saw you...

16:09.550 --> 16:11.570
Go on, have a seat.

16:12.490 --> 16:13.990
Oh, this is for you.

16:13.990 --> 16:16.360
Cakes and... skewers?

16:16.360 --> 16:18.030
What an odd combination.

16:20.030 --> 16:22.000
I got them both for free.

16:22.280 --> 16:25.850
Well, since we have them, 
I'll put some tea on.

16:25.850 --> 16:28.740
Isn't that kind of thing your maid's job?

16:30.040 --> 16:32.550
I had Sophia teach me how to do it.

16:32.550 --> 16:35.760
I can cook about as well 
as anyone else, too!

16:36.020 --> 16:37.670
Really?

16:37.670 --> 16:39.890
I keep falling for her more and more!

16:42.770 --> 16:46.220
Happiness and Raven are friends now?

16:46.220 --> 16:49.270
Yeah, and that led to 
all this other stuff...

16:49.690 --> 16:52.700
I know Mikana and Yuga now, too.

16:52.700 --> 16:55.410
I hope things work out 
between all of them.

16:56.040 --> 16:56.980
Um...

16:57.700 --> 16:59.830
Cecilia!

16:58.820 --> 17:00.370
Stop it, Yuga!

17:01.240 --> 17:02.380
Cecilia!

17:03.160 --> 17:05.620
I've realized my mistake!

17:06.010 --> 17:08.880
So would you please scold m—

17:09.810 --> 17:12.120
That's not what we're here for, you idiot!

17:12.120 --> 17:13.370
Ow!

17:14.040 --> 17:16.050
What are you doing here?!

17:16.050 --> 17:17.890
What? Yoki?

17:18.150 --> 17:19.900
Sorry for interrupting.

17:20.230 --> 17:23.890
We came here to apologize to you.

17:23.890 --> 17:24.770
Huh?

17:26.300 --> 17:27.870
I'll just come out and say it.

17:28.570 --> 17:29.710
I'm sorry.

17:30.360 --> 17:32.110
Um...

17:32.430 --> 17:34.740
Anything I say will just 
sound like an excuse.

17:35.460 --> 17:38.620
I... left you behind.

17:40.520 --> 17:42.620
You're talking about 
what happened back then?

17:43.210 --> 17:44.650
It's not your fault, Mikana.

17:44.990 --> 17:47.480
We were all just spineless cowards.

17:47.480 --> 17:51.400
That's why we left you alone 
with that terrifying demon.

17:52.120 --> 17:54.630
If that's what you're worried 
about, it's all right.

17:54.630 --> 17:58.840
But we abandoned you! Our teammate!

17:58.840 --> 18:04.100
I'm not the only one whose 
life was on the line.

18:05.160 --> 18:11.110
Fighting the Demon King without a healer 
must have been a terrible struggle.

18:11.360 --> 18:16.240
How?! How can humans be so powerful?!

18:16.610 --> 18:21.670
Holy Sword Excalibur!

18:28.710 --> 18:31.710
We did it! We defeated the Demon King!

18:43.150 --> 18:45.590
Please be alive!

18:51.790 --> 18:53.020
Mikana!

18:57.970 --> 18:59.240
You won, then?

19:00.120 --> 19:02.510
Cecilia! You're okay!

19:04.300 --> 19:07.700
Mikana! I'll heal you right away!

19:09.080 --> 19:11.640
Your strength and magic were both drained,

19:12.210 --> 19:15.710
but you still came running to check on me.

19:16.020 --> 19:18.210
The hero and Raven, too.

19:19.720 --> 19:23.970
At the time, there was no other way.

19:24.360 --> 19:27.220
Mikana, you did nothing wrong.

19:29.670 --> 19:32.230
We're all alive, aren't we?

19:39.390 --> 19:43.100
Thanks, um... Cecilia.

19:44.150 --> 19:45.830
I really am sorry.

19:46.510 --> 19:51.250
I'M SO SORRY.

19:47.740 --> 19:50.480
This is the kind of thing 
you should say out loud!

19:50.480 --> 19:51.250
Huh?

20:06.180 --> 20:11.540
You were the one who gave 
them advice, weren't you?

20:12.840 --> 20:14.020
You could tell, huh?

20:14.250 --> 20:17.820
It seemed like things got awkward 
between you all because of me,

20:18.540 --> 20:20.110
so I just... y'know.

20:20.630 --> 20:22.150
Thank you.

20:22.530 --> 20:23.780
For what?

20:23.780 --> 20:25.260
I'm really happy.

20:25.800 --> 20:30.680
You've grown close with 
my family and friends,

20:30.680 --> 20:33.040
and you seem to be 
fitting into this world.

20:35.770 --> 20:37.450
Um, um...

20:39.690 --> 20:41.800
Here. For you.

20:53.060 --> 20:54.300
This is...

20:55.030 --> 20:58.820
Yeah. The one we saw that day 
when we went out together.

21:02.230 --> 21:04.570
Will you... accept it?

21:09.480 --> 21:12.330
Yes. I'll treasure it!

21:15.330 --> 21:17.450
Thank you, Cecilia!

21:17.450 --> 21:20.090
What?! I'm the one who just got a gift!

21:20.310 --> 21:22.840
I'm so relieved!

21:24.060 --> 21:25.720
Thank you!

21:26.620 --> 21:31.820
I feel like everything has been 
so much fun since I met Yoki.

23:05.080 --> 23:07.490
Run! Run away!

23:08.680 --> 23:10.920
Run! Run!

23:12.320 --> 23:14.830
Hand over everything ya 
got that's worth money!

23:14.830 --> 23:17.050
A-All right.

23:17.050 --> 23:21.710
Just, please, spare the 
lives of the villagers...

23:21.960 --> 23:25.920
Sure, but the women and 
children are gonna be—

23:28.760 --> 23:30.080
Who the hell are you?!

23:30.080 --> 23:31.840
How dare you do that to our boss?!

23:31.840 --> 23:33.320
Get 'im!

23:49.750 --> 23:51.250
Talk about boring.
